 kernel-configs/i386-config-4.7   | 367 --------------------------------------
 kernel-configs/x86_64-config-4.7 | 371 --------------------------------------
 5 files changed, 1835 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 kernel-configs/i386-config-3.3
